# MyWealthLens — .gitignore
# Added as part of Phase I prep after discovering instance/ (database +
# uploaded documents) had been committed to a public repo. See Phase I
# final report for full context.

# ── Instance folder: database + all uploaded user documents ──
# This is exactly where real financial data and uploaded files
# (insurance policies, retirement documents, wealth documents) live.
# None of it belongs in version control.
instance/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ── Python ──
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environment ──
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ── Editor / OS ──
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Logs ──
*.log

# ── Local scratch / audit output (not meant for version control) ──
audit_report.txt